Patch 0001 do SDL_ttf 3.2.2 vendorizado (Agents-Hub, F0-12)

Lib:       SDL_ttf 3.2.2 (native/third_party/sdl_ttf/, release-3.2.2-0-ga1ce367)
Arquivo:   src/SDL_ttf.c, só a função BG_Blended_Color
Origem:    backport dos hunks de BG_Blended_Color de dois commits do upstream
           (libsdl-org/SDL_ttf, branch main), sem nada a mais:
           - 6ea7d33927211629bf8326b7cc6caad34f3d4122 (2025-07-14)
             "Make various pointers Uint8* in glyph blitting functions to avoid
             creating misaligned pointers"
             https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL_ttf/commit/6ea7d33927211629bf8326b7cc6caad34f3d4122
           - a9a4fea81b41f3ceefcfacd5b32fa3e838a554c0 (2025-07-15)
             "Fixed invalid write in BG_Blended_Color() after previous change (6ea7d33)"
             (o 6ea7d33 escreveu `dst += sizeof(Uint32)` no ramo opaco; o
             a9a4fea corrige para `dst += 1`)
             https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL_ttf/commit/a9a4fea81b41f3ceefcfacd5b32fa3e838a554c0
           Os outros hunks do 6ea7d33 (BG_Blended_LCD, BG_Blended_32, SSE, BG_*
           de 8 bits, Render_Line) NÃO foram trazidos.
           Resultado: BG_Blended_Color fica idêntica à do main do upstream
           (conferido em 2026-10-01 com diff da função).
Motivo:    UB de alinhamento. No ramo opaco de BG_Blended_Color (glifos
           coloridos, ex.: emoji COLR) o 3.2.2 lê `*src++` como Uint32 num
           buffer desalinhado. O UBSan do preset windows-clangcl-asan aborta o
           teste unit.ui_smoke (render do emoji): "SDL_ttf.c:467:13: runtime
           error: load of misaligned address ... for type 'const Uint32'".
Data:      2026-10-01
Aplicação: o fonte versionado em native/third_party/sdl_ttf/ JÁ contém este
           patch; o build não aplica nada. Este arquivo é registro e prova:
           `git apply --check -R` dele, a partir da raiz do repositório, tem de
           funcionar. Remover (e restaurar o arquivo do tarball) quando houver
           release do SDL_ttf com a correção. Ver native/third_party/VERSIONS.md,
           "Patches aplicados".

diff --git a/native/third_party/sdl_ttf/src/SDL_ttf.c b/native/third_party/sdl_ttf/src/SDL_ttf.c
index be517a1..fa0a5ce 100644
--- a/native/third_party/sdl_ttf/src/SDL_ttf.c
+++ b/native/third_party/sdl_ttf/src/SDL_ttf.c
@@ -456,7 +456,7 @@ static bool Find_GlyphByIndex(TTF_Font *font, FT_UInt idx, int want_bitmap, int
 // Blend colored glyphs
 static void BG_Blended_Color(const TTF_Image *image, Uint32 *destination, Sint32 srcskip, Uint32 dstskip, Uint8 fg_alpha)
 {
-    const Uint32 *src   = (Uint32 *)image->buffer;
+    const Uint8  *src   = image->buffer;
     Uint32      *dst    = destination;
     Uint32       width  = image->width;
     Uint32       height = image->rows;
@@ -465,10 +465,12 @@ static void BG_Blended_Color(const TTF_Image *image, Uint32 *destination, Sint32
         while (height--) {
             /* *INDENT-OFF* */
             DUFFS_LOOP4(
-                *dst++ = *src++;
+                SDL_memcpy(dst, src, sizeof(Uint32));
+                src += sizeof(Uint32);
+                dst += 1;
             , width);
             /* *INDENT-ON* */
-            src = (const Uint32 *)((const Uint8 *)src + srcskip);
+            src += srcskip;
             dst = (Uint32 *)((Uint8 *)dst + dstskip);
         }
     } else {
@@ -480,7 +482,8 @@ static void BG_Blended_Color(const TTF_Image *image, Uint32 *destination, Sint32
             DUFFS_LOOP4(
                     /* prevent misaligned load: tmp = *src++; */
                     // eventually, we can expect the compiler to replace the memcpy call with something optimized
-                    SDL_memcpy(&tmp, src++, sizeof(tmp));
+                    SDL_memcpy(&tmp, src, sizeof(tmp));
+                    src += sizeof(Uint32);
                     alpha = tmp >> 24;
                     tmp &= ~0xFF000000;
                     alpha = fg_alpha * alpha;
@@ -488,7 +491,7 @@ static void BG_Blended_Color(const TTF_Image *image, Uint32 *destination, Sint32
                     *dst++ = tmp | alpha
                     , width);
             /* *INDENT-ON* */
-            src = (const Uint32 *)((const Uint8 *)src + srcskip);
+            src += srcskip;
             dst = (Uint32 *)((Uint8 *)dst + dstskip);
         }
     }
